  "releaseNotes": "Join me on Developer Thoughts, https://egvijayanand.in/, an exclusive blog for .NET MAUI and Blazor.\n\nWhat's new in ver. 4.3.0:\n-------------------------\nAn extended ObservableRangeCollection<T> type that allows adding, replacing, and removing multiple items at once from the ObservableCollection<T> type.\n\nThe IDataStore<T> interface has been updated to support a generic ID type, allowing the use of identifier type beyond just string.\n\nv4.2.0:\n\nPackage suite update.\n\nv4.1.0:\n\nPackage suite update.\n\nv4.0.0:\n\nRelease built on top of .NET 9.",
